=== n + n * n (right operand tighter) ===
Stack                               Remaining          Action
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
⊥                                   n + n * n $        SHIFT  n -> state 5
n                                   + n * n $          REDUCE F->n
F                                   + n * n $          REDUCE T->F
T                                   + n * n $          REDUCE E->T
E                                   + n * n $          SHIFT  + -> state 6
E +                                 n * n $            SHIFT  n -> state 5
E + n                               * n $              REDUCE F->n
E + F                               * n $              REDUCE T->F
E + T                               * n $              SHIFT  * -> state 7
E + T *                             n $                SHIFT  n -> state 5
E + T * n                           $                  REDUCE F->n
E + T * F                           $                  REDUCE T->T*F
E + T                               $                  REDUCE E->E+T
E                                   $                  ACCEPT OK

=== n * n + n (left operand tighter) ===
Stack                               Remaining          Action
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
⊥                                   n * n + n $        SHIFT  n -> state 5
n                                   * n + n $          REDUCE F->n
F                                   * n + n $          REDUCE T->F
T                                   * n + n $          SHIFT  * -> state 7
T *                                 n + n $            SHIFT  n -> state 5
T * n                               + n $              REDUCE F->n
T * F                               + n $              REDUCE T->T*F
T                                   + n $              REDUCE E->T
E                                   + n $              SHIFT  + -> state 6
E +                                 n $                SHIFT  n -> state 5
E + n                               $                  REDUCE F->n
E + F                               $                  REDUCE T->F
E + T                               $                  REDUCE E->E+T
E                                   $                  ACCEPT OK
